# Job Postings — Frontend Reference & Postman Test Guide

---

## 🔗 API Endpoints

| # | Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|--------|----------|-------------|
| 1 | **POST** | `/api/college/create_job` | Create job (with positions, criteria, rounds, questions) |
| 2 | **GET** | `/api/college/get_all_jobs` | List jobs (filter, sort, search, paginate) |
| 3 | **GET** | `/api/college/get_job/:jobId` | Full details (positions + criteria + rounds + questions + stats) |
| 4 | **PUT** | `/api/college/update_job/:jobId` | Update core fields |
| 5 | **PATCH** | `/api/college/update_job_status/:jobId` | Change status (draft → published → closed → cancelled) |

> **Auth**: JWT cookie from college admin / TPO login required.

---

## 📝 API 1: Create Job (Transaction — 4 tables)

**`POST /api/college/create_job`** — Creates job + positions + criteria + rounds + questions in one transaction.

### Full Request Body

```json
{
  "company_id": "<companyId from get_all_companies>",
  "job_title": "Software Developer — Campus 2026",
  "job_description": "TCS is hiring fresh graduates for the Software Developer role...",
  "job_location": "Mumbai, Pune, Bangalore",
  "salary_package": "7 LPA",
  "salary_min": 700000,
  "salary_max": 700000,
  "bond_duration": "2 years",
  "bond_details": "If employee leaves before 2 years, Rs. 1,00,000 penalty applies",
  "job_type": "full-time",
  "internship_duration": null,
  "internship_stipend": null,
  "passout_year": 2026,
  "application_deadline": "2026-03-15T23:59:59Z",

  "positions": [
    {
      "position_name": "Software Developer",
      "position_description": "Full-stack development using Java and React",
      "vacancies": 25
    },
    {
      "position_name": "System Engineer",
      "position_description": "Infrastructure and cloud operations",
      "vacancies": 15
    }
  ],

  "eligibility_criteria": {
    "min_overall_cgpa": 7.0,
    "max_live_kts": 0,
    "min_tenth_percentage": 60,
    "min_twelfth_percentage": 55,
    "min_diploma_percentage": 60,
    "allowed_genders": ["male", "female", "other"],
    "allowed_departments": ["Computer Engineering", "Information Technology", "Electronics"],
    "exclude_already_placed": false
  },

  "rounds": [
    {
      "round_number": 1,
      "round_name": "Aptitude Test",
      "round_type": "written",
      "round_venue": "College Exam Hall"
    },
    {
      "round_number": 2,
      "round_name": "Technical Interview",
      "round_type": "interview"
    },
    {
      "round_number": 3,
      "round_name": "HR Interview",
      "round_type": "interview"
    }
  ],

  "questions": [
    {
      "question_text": "Why do you want to join TCS?",
      "question_type": "essay",
      "is_required": true,
      "question_order": 1
    },
    {
      "question_text": "Are you willing to relocate?",
      "question_type": "yes_no",
      "is_required": true,
      "question_order": 2
    },
    {
      "question_text": "Preferred work location?",
      "question_type": "mcq_single",
      "question_options": ["Mumbai", "Pune", "Bangalore", "Hyderabad", "Chennai"],
      "is_required": false,
      "question_order": 3
    }
  ]
}
```

### Core Job Fields

| Field | Type | Required | UI Element | Validation |
|-------|------|----------|------------|------------|
| `company_id` | UUID | ✅ | **Dropdown** (from `get_all_companies`) | Must be active company |
| `job_title` | string | ✅ | **Single-line input** | 3-300 chars |
| `job_description` | string | ❌ | **Rich Textarea** (6-8 rows) | Max 5000 chars |
| `job_location` | string | ✅ | **Single-line input** | 2-300 chars |
| `salary_package` | string | ❌ | **Single-line input** | e.g. "7 LPA" |
| `salary_min` | number | ❌ | **Number input** | ≥ 0 |
| `salary_max` | number | ❌ | **Number input** | ≥ salary_min |
| `bond_duration` | string | ❌ | **Single-line input** | e.g. "2 years" |
| `bond_details` | string | ❌ | **Textarea** (2-3 rows) | Max 1000 chars |
| `job_type` | string | ✅ | **Dropdown** | `full-time`, `internship`, `both` |
| `internship_duration` | string | ❌ | **Single-line input** | Show only if job_type = internship/both |
| `internship_stipend` | string | ❌ | **Single-line input** | Show only if job_type = internship/both |
| `passout_year` | integer | ✅ | **Dropdown** (2020–2040) | — |
| `application_deadline` | datetime | ✅ | **DateTime picker** | Must be future |

### Nested: Positions (required, min 1)

| Field | Type | Required | UI Element |
|-------|------|----------|------------|
| `position_name` | string | ✅ | **Single-line input** |
| `position_description` | string | ❌ | **Textarea** |
| `vacancies` | integer | ❌ | **Number input** (min 1) |

> Use an **"Add Position"** button to add multiple positions. Show as a repeatable card/row.

### Nested: Eligibility Criteria (optional)

| Field | Type | UI Element | Notes |
|-------|------|------------|-------|
| `min_overall_cgpa` | number | **Number input** (0–10, step 0.1) | e.g. 7.0 |
| `max_live_kts` | integer | **Number input** (0–20) | Default 0 |
| `min_tenth_percentage` | number | **Number input** (0–100) | |
| `min_twelfth_percentage` | number | **Number input** (0–100) | |
| `min_diploma_percentage` | number | **Number input** (0–100) | |
| `allowed_genders` | string[] | **Multi-select checkboxes** | male, female, other |
| `allowed_departments` | string[] | **Multi-select dropdown** | From `get_departments` API |
| `exclude_already_placed` | boolean | **Toggle** | Default false |

### Nested: Rounds (optional)

| Field | Type | Required | UI Element |
|-------|------|----------|------------|
| `round_number` | integer | ✅ | **Auto-increment** (1, 2, 3...) |
| `round_name` | string | ✅ | **Single-line input** |
| `round_type` | string | ❌ | **Dropdown**: written, interview, GD, coding, HR |
| `round_date` | datetime | ❌ | **DateTime picker** |
| `round_venue` | string | ❌ | **Single-line input** |

> Use a **sortable list** with "Add Round" button. Auto-number rounds.

### Nested: Questions (optional)

| Field | Type | Required | UI Element |
|-------|------|----------|------------|
| `question_text` | string | ✅ | **Textarea** |
| `question_type` | string | ✅ | **Dropdown**: `text`, `essay`, `yes_no`, `mcq_single`, `mcq_multiple` |
| `question_options` | string[] | ✅ (MCQ only) | **Repeatable input list** (min 2, max 10) |
| `is_required` | boolean | ❌ | **Toggle** (default true) |
| `question_order` | integer | ✅ | **Auto-increment** |

