## 📝 API 2: List All Jobs

**`GET /api/college/get_all_jobs`**

### Query Parameters
| Param | Type | Required | Default | Notes |
|-------|------|----------|---------|-------|
| `passout_year` | integer | ❌ | all | Filter by batch |
| `job_status` | string | ❌ | all | draft / published / closed / cancelled |
| `company_id` | UUID | ❌ | all | Filter by company |
| `job_type` | string | ❌ | all | full-time / internship / both |
| `search` | string | ❌ | — | Searches title, company, location |
| `sort_by` | string | ❌ | `created_at` | job_title, created_at, application_deadline, passout_year |
| `sort_order` | string | ❌ | `desc` | asc / desc |
| `page` / `limit` | integer | ❌ | 1 / 20 | Pagination |

### Response — Each item includes enriched data
```json
{
  "data": [
    {
      "job_id": "...",
      "company_name": "TCS",
      "company_logo": "https://...",
      "job_title": "Software Developer — Campus 2026",
      "job_type": "full-time",
      "job_location": "Mumbai, Pune",
      "salary_package": "7 LPA",
      "passout_year": 2026,
      "application_deadline": "2026-03-15T23:59:59Z",
      "job_status": "draft",
      "positions_count": 2,
      "applications_count": 0,
      "created_by_name": "Prof. Sharma"
    }
  ]
}
```

---

## 📝 API 3: Get Job Detail

**`GET /api/college/get_job/:jobId`** — Returns complete job with all nested data + application stats.

Key additions vs. list: `positions[]`, `eligibility_criteria{}`, `rounds[]`, `questions[]`, `application_stats{ total, pending, shortlisted, selected, rejected }`

---

## 📝 API 4: Update Job

**`PUT /api/college/update_job/:jobId`** — Core fields only, min 1 field required. Cannot edit cancelled jobs.

---

## 📝 API 5: Update Job Status

**`PATCH /api/college/update_job_status/:jobId`**

```json
{ "job_status": "published" }
```

### Status Lifecycle

```
  ┌──────────┐     publish     ┌────────────┐     close    ┌──────────┐
  │  DRAFT   │ ──────────────→ │ PUBLISHED  │ ───────────→ │  CLOSED  │
  └──────────┘                 └────────────┘              └──────────┘
       │                            │                           │
       │  cancel                    │  cancel                   │ reopen
       ▼                            ▼                           ▼
  ┌────────────┐              ┌────────────┐              ┌────────────┐
  │ CANCELLED  │              │ CANCELLED  │              │ PUBLISHED  │
  │ (terminal) │              │ (terminal) │              │            │
  └────────────┘              └────────────┘              └────────────┘
```

| From | To | Pre-condition |
|------|----|---------------|
| draft → published | ✅ | Must have ≥1 active position |
| draft → cancelled | ✅ | — |
| published → closed | ✅ | — |
| published → cancelled | ✅ | — |
| closed → published | ✅ | Reopen |
| cancelled → anything | ❌ | Terminal state |

---

## 🔄 Integration Map

```
Companies (existing)          Job Postings (YOU ARE HERE)
    │                              │
    │ company_id ────────────→     │ job_id
    │                              ├──→ Job Positions
    │                              ├──→ Job Eligibility Criteria
Company Contacts (existing)        ├──→ Job Rounds
    │ (reference for HR)           ├──→ Application Questions
    │                              │
    └──────────────────────────    ▼
                              Student Applications (future)
                                   ├──→ Application Answers
                                   ├──→ Round Results
                                   └──→ Placement Results
```

### Frontend Navigation
```
Job List Page → Click job → Job Detail Page
                            ├── Info Tab (editable)
                            ├── Positions Tab
                            ├── Eligibility Tab
                            ├── Rounds Tab (with round status management)
                            ├── Questions Tab
                            └── Applications Tab (future)
```

