## 🎨 Frontend UI Recommendations

### Create Job — Multi-Step Form
| Step | Section | Content |
|------|---------|---------|
| 1 | **Basic Info** | Company (dropdown), Title, Location, Type, Year, Deadline |
| 2 | **Salary & Bond** | Package, Min/Max, Bond Duration/Details |
| 3 | **Positions** | Repeatable card: Name, Description, Vacancies |
| 4 | **Eligibility** | CGPA, KTs, Percentages, Departments (multi-select), Genders |
| 5 | **Rounds** | Sortable list: Name, Type, Date, Venue |
| 6 | **Questions** | Repeatable: Text, Type, Options (conditional), Required toggle |
| 7 | **Review** | Summary of all data → Submit |

### Job List Page
- **Filter bar**: Year dropdown + Status tabs (All/Draft/Published/Closed) + Company filter + Search
- **Table**: Company (logo+name), Title, Type, Location, Deadline, Status (badge), Positions, Applications, Actions
- **Status badges**: Draft (gray), Published (green), Closed (blue), Cancelled (red)

### Job Detail Page
- **Header**: Title + Company + Status badge + Action buttons (Edit, Publish/Close/Cancel)
- **Tabs**: Info | Positions | Eligibility | Rounds | Questions | Applications
